<%#
    The profile card: who this blog is by, and who else has written in it.

    With no collaborator who has contributed anything, this is the card that was
    always here — the same three partials, in the same order, emitting the same
    markup. Nothing is wrapped, nothing is measured differently, and the bento
    row that is pinned to this card's own height is unchanged.

    With collaborators, the card becomes a PAGER over the same three rows. Each
    page is avatar, name and the tags/categories/posts count, so every page is
    the same height as the one the card already had — the role marker rides
    INSIDE the name's line box rather than under it, and the dots sit in the
    card's own bottom padding. The card therefore keeps its size exactly, which
    is what lets it stay furniture in a grid row it does not negotiate for.

    See source/js/layouts/profilePager.js for the movement.
%>
<% const crew = collaboratorContributions(); %>
<% if (!crew.length) { %>
    <%- partial("components/sidebar/avatar") %>
    <%- partial("components/sidebar/author") %>
    <%- partial('components/sidebar/statistics') %>
<% } else { %>
    <div class="sb-pager" data-profile-pager>
        <div class="sb-track" data-profile-track>
            <div class="sb-page">
                <%- partial("components/sidebar/avatar") %>
                <%- partial("components/sidebar/author") %>
                <%- partial('components/sidebar/statistics') %>
            </div>
            <% crew.forEach((person) => { %>
            <div class="sb-page">
                <div class="avatar flex justify-center">
                    <%- image_tag(person.avatar, { alt: person.name, loading: "lazy", decoding: "async" }) %>
                </div>
                <div class="author flex flex-col justify-center my-2.5 mx-0">
                    <div class="name sb-name-row">
                        <span class="sb-name"><%= person.name %></span>
                        <span class="sb-role"><%= __('collab.label') %></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <%- partial('components/sidebar/statistics', { stats: person }) %>
            </div>
            <% }); %>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sb-dots" data-profile-dots>
        <% for (let i = 0; i <= crew.length; i++) { %>
        <button type="button" class="sb-dot<%= i === 0 ? ' is-on' : '' %>" data-profile-dot="<%= i %>"
                aria-label="<%= i === 0 ? (theme.info.author || config.author) : crew[i - 1].name %>"></button>
        <% } %>
    </div>
<% } %>
